  <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
    <name>DecorationBotAddressDescription</name>
    <id>4</id>
    <title>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>To receive notifications in Telegram, register in the bot.
Follow the link and click Start.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>برای دریافت اعلان‌ها در Telegram، در ربات ثبت‌نام کنید.
روی پیوند کلیک کرده و Start را بزنید.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Для получения оповещений в Telegram необходимо зарегистрироваться в боте.
Перейти по ссылке, нажать кнопку Старт.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Telegram'da bildirim almak için bota kayıt olmanız gerekmektedir.
Bağlantıyı takip edin ve Başlat butonuna tıklayın.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>To receive notifications in Telegram, register in the bot.
Follow the link and click Start.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>To receive notifications in Telegram, register in the bot.
Follow the link and click Start.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>To receive notifications in Telegram, register in the bot.
Follow the link and click Start.</value>
    </title>
    <visible>true</visible>
    <enabled>true</enabled>
    <userVisible>
      <common>true</common>
    </userVisible>
    <extendedTooltip>
      <name>DecorationBotAddressDescriptionExtendedTooltip</name>
      <id>6</id>
